                <pb facs="0327" n="235" sameAs="frus:frus1899/pg235"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Hay to Mr.
                            Hart</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1898-10-03"><hi rendition="#italic">October 3,
                        1898</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>The Panama Star and Herald claim is in the charge of this Government, and you
                    will press its immediate payment.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hay.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
